# Implements: SPEC-602 (predicting-client session, driven in real time by mp_drive.py: "<delay s> <command>",
# "wait <timeout> <regex>" on the client log). Actions are separated by idle gaps so that both modules see the same
# discrete inputs; taps (0.1 s) give single shots, holds of about 1 s give short bursts (+-1 shot between runs).
wait 400 Welcome to Soldier of Fortune
3 echo OMTEST marker elbow
0 elbow
4 echo OMTEST marker pistol1
0 +attack
0.1 -attack
2 +attack
1 -attack
2 reload
3 echo OMTEST marker switch assault
0 weaponselect 7
3 +attack
0.1 -attack
2 +attack
1 -attack
2 reload
